ting are blocked while masked; after revealing the text, copying works normally.",[335,361,362,363,365,366,369],{},"Changing ",[295,364,307],{}," or ",[295,367,368],{},"hideMaskToggle"," dynamically resets to the masked state.",[335,371,372,373,376],{},"When the text alignment is changed with ",[295,374,375],{},"ui.base",", the partial mask overlay follows the alignment.",[305,378,380],{"id":379},"toggle-icons","Toggle icons",[292,382,383,386,387,390],{},[295,384,385],{},"reveal-icon"," is shown while masked (press it to reveal the text), and ",[295,388,389],{},"conceal-icon"," is shown while the text is revealed (press it to mask again).",[328,392],{"name":393},"input-text-mask-icons",[305,395,397],{"id":396},"variants","Variants",[292,399,400,401,352,404,407,408,411,412,298],{},"Uses the ",[295,402,403],{},"variant",[295,405,406],{},"color"," and ",[295,409,410],{},"highlight"," of ",[295,413,414],{},"UInput",[328,416],{"name":417},"input-text-variant",[305,419,421],{"id":420},"icon","Icon",[292,423,400,424,411,426,428,429,314,432,434],{},[295,425,420],{},[295,427,414],{},"; when ",[295,430,431],{},"trailing",[295,433,317],{},", the icon goes on the right.",[328,436],{"name":437},"input-text-icon",[305,439,441],{"id":440},"size-and-states","Size and states",[292,443,444,445,449],{},"When disabled, the text can still be revealed; during the skeleton it cannot be used. See ",[446,447,102],"a",{"href":448},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Foverview\u002Fcommon"," for the behavior shared by all states.",[328,451],{"name":452},"input-text-states",[300,454,456],{"id":455},"examples","Examples",[305,458,460],{"id":459},"with-form-validation","With form validation",[292,462,463,464,467,468,471],{},"Use ",[295,465,466],{},"requiredText"," for required fields and check the format separately with ",[295,469,470],{},"v.regex",". Masking only affects the display; the original text is what gets validated and submitted.",[328,473],{"name":474},"input-text-validation",[305,476,478],{"id":47